 just give a  test to the pump  just because it's here it's fun it's hot  and because last week we cleaned the  well so it should be quite quick to get  some flowing water on the land  so we'll just make a new lid lower the  pump and hook it up to extension cords  and see what happens  coming  so we're now using the pump  and it uses around  1300 watt  we have a bit more stuff standing on  so yeah drawing a lot of energy  nice one  okay so that all seems to be good now  the plant's got some water and it's time  to go back to the water system and  pressure tank still need to explain you  why they are so cool so pressure tank is  here to make sure that every time you  want water the pump doesn't necessarily  have to start so in the old days people  used to build for instance a water tower  so you pump up the water in a big  quantity and then slowly with gravity  you have pressure on your water and you  can use it but the downside is well you  need to build this big tower so what you  have nowadays is pressure tanks and what  this basically means is a tank metal one  and there's a balloon inside  and as the  water pumps in the balloon with air  shrinks but it kind of wants to expand  so this gives a pressure to the water so  in this way you can fill up your  pressure tank with water  and the balloon here gets compressed  which means it builds pressure and then  every time you open up the water tap the  water comes out here and the balloon  just expands a little bit  but it means that the pump doesn't have  to go on and off every time you open up  the tap  now  in order to connect this you need a few  parts so the world of water components  is quite big you have a lot of different  options and within each option you also  have different sizes from one inch one  and a half inch etc  so it's quite some puzzling to make this  happen so the components i use is what i  could find here locally after a lot of  puzzling in the store  so let me explain what you need to hook  this up first you need this part and  this makes sure water can only flow in  one direction as you can see  that's where the water could flow  and not in that way it's because this  little valve make sure it can only open  in  one way so you can really build up  pressure in a closed system on one side  next we're gonna have a t-piece  so this piece has a few additional holes  which are very crucial to set up a  pressure tank  first i need to add a little connector  in between  now we connect it  [Music]  so now we can add a few additional items  first  a bar meter so this thing measures the  pressure in your system then we have a  pressure switch  so this thing is wired to your  electronics and connected to the pump  and it measures the amount of pressure  you have in your system and if it goes  too low it would tell the pump to start  and if it's at a good level it would  stop the pump so this is very important  to maintain your water pressure  so we're going to put that on top  then we're going to use another t piece  you can probably find other parts for  this but this is what i could find so  this is going to use to connect the tap  now we can put on the top  now this is not going to be the final  tap this is just going to be a tap for  maintenance to make sure we can empty  the system  and then we're going to add a main  switch  so just make sure we can turn off our  whole water system at once  next we're gonna get a tube to connect  actually to the pressure tank in our  case we use a flexible tube  we're gonna mount that to the back of  the t-piece  and what would actually also be good to  have is a pressure valve to make sure if  there's an overload of pressure the  valve releases it i couldn't find that  all these components are now sourced  here locally in the hardware stores  trying to puzzle it together  it takes quite some time actually  you can also buy a tps online as a kit i  could only find them in the us but it  seems very convenient because you kind  