d i tried to hammer it  [Music]  yeah really good to have running water  especially after almost a year of  filling up cherry cans  we can now take fresh shower wash our  clothes and clean our dishes  so that's been really good  if you like what we do make sure to  visit support.projectcom.com  thank you guys for watching and see you  in the next video

